{%- comment -%}
  Plan my site box. Built by tools/plan-cta/build.py; edit there.
  Params: key (a page handle), mode ('product' looks at product.collections). Default: collection.handle.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign pf = ''
